<title>USA: D.R. Horton net sales rise in year.</title>
<headline>D.R. Horton net sales rise in year.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Texas 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>D.R. Horton Inc said Thursday its net sales for the year ended September 30 rose 37 percent from the prior year, to $585.5 million, or 3,488 homes, from $449.3 million, or 2,553 homes.</p>
<p>The company's backlog of homes under contract at September 30 increased 22 percent from a year earlier, to 1,204 homes, or $208.9 million, from 1,000 homes, or $170.7 million.</p>
<p>For the fiscal fourth quarter, net sales contracts signed increased 12 percent from a year ago, to $128.3 million, or 765 homes, from $118.6 million, or 681 homes.</p>
